# Comma separated subset of services to run: group names (infra, web,
# integrations) and/or individual service names (SQL, WebApp, Accounts,
# DiscordBot, GameBridge, IRC, Motd, Markov, Starboard, Fluxer, Github,
# Gitlab, Steam, Resonite, Addons, Bans, OIDC, DiscordMetadata).
# Unset or empty means all services, as production runs.
#METACONCORD_SERVICES=infra,web
